SUMMARY:Fallout 4 | Ep. 56 - Going to Far Harbor Because Bad Decisions
 Need Variety
DESCRIPTION:Apparently wandering through radioactive fog wasn't enough the
 first time. Back to Far Harbor we go, where mystery, monsters, and
 questionable decisions await. As the sole survivor of Vault 111, you enter
 a world destroyed by nuclear war. Every second is a fight for survival,
 and every choice is yours. Only you can rebuild and determine the fate of
 the Wasteland. Welcome home.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bPNqCq6zpAw
CATEGORIES:Fallout 4
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
