SUMMARY:Movie Night | Ep. 75 - Hot Shots! Part Deux (1993)
DESCRIPTION:We wrap up the week with another community Movie Night, this
 time enjoying the brilliantly over-the-top comedy sequel Hot Shots! Part
 Deux. Grab your favourite snacks and settle in! Meet you all on Discord
 for Movie Night.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Movie Night
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
