SUMMARY:Construction Simulator | Ep. 42 - Nothing Says Progress Like More
 Concrete
DESCRIPTION:Back to the construction site, where apparently the solution
 to every engineering problem is simply more concrete. Big machines, bigger
 projects, and absolutely flawless construction techniques await.
 Construction Simulator is back - bigger and better than ever! Take charge
 of over 70 machines, dozens of them brand new to the franchise, and build
 to your heart's content on two huge maps - on your own or with your
 friends!
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BFk31Aa4nWg
CATEGORIES:Construction Simulator
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
