SUMMARY:Sniper Elite III | Ep. 11 - Save Churchill Part 2: Belly of the
 Beast DLC
DESCRIPTION:Our mission to protect Churchill continues with Part 2 of the
 Save Churchill DLC. Expect tense stealth, tactical planning, and precision
 shooting as we head deeper into enemy territory. Sniper Elite 3 is a
 tactical third-person shooter that combines stealth, gameplay choice and
 genre-defining ballistics with huge, open levels and the exotic terrain of
 World War 2 North Africa.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TK9vwKo7NTc
CATEGORIES:Sniper Elite III
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
