LAST-MODIFIED:20260808T001700Z
DTSTART:20260807T203000Z
DTEND:20260807T223000Z
SUMMARY:WET | Ep. 1 - Cool People Don't Use Stairs
DESCRIPTION:The frontier is changing, and Saint Denis represents
 everything our outlaws aren't prepared for. Crowded streets, civilisation,
 trouble, and probably more attention from the law than we'd like. A
 stylish action shooter that blends fast-paced gunplay, sword combat, and
 cinematic acrobatics. Players follow mercenary Rubi Malone as she takes on
 dangerous jobs, battling through waves of enemies using slow-motion stunts
 inspired by classic action films. Expect explosive set pieces,
 over-the-top action, and plenty of style.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I0tXTi8tijo
CATEGORIES:WET
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
