SUMMARY:Fallout 4 | Ep. 57 - The Fog Has Things in It. Of Course It Does.
DESCRIPTION:Our Far Harbor adventure continues, and apparently the
 radioactive fog wasn't concerning enough on its own. Something's moving
 out there. Obviously we're going to investigate. As the sole survivor of
 Vault 111, you enter a world destroyed by nuclear war. Every second is a
 fight for survival, and every choice is yours. Only you can rebuild and
 determine the fate of the Wasteland. Welcome home.
