DESCRIPTION: Deliverage is a hardcore open-world PvP delivery game where
 every shipment is a gamble. Fight other players for valuable cargo, repair
 and modify fragile vehicles, outplay rivals in a shifting economy, and
 climb from nothing to the top of a ruthless world.
